@api = http://localhost:5080/api
@candidateToken = paste-access-token-here

### API and database reachable?
GET {{api}}/health

### Sign in as a Candidate and copy accessToken into candidateToken above.
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@hackathon.local",
  "password": "User123!"
}

### Read the signed-in Candidate's profile.
GET {{api}}/candidates/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Update the signed-in Candidate's profile and selected skills.
PUT {{api}}/candidates/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "headline": "Backend developer",
  "bio": "I build APIs using C# and PostgreSQL.",
  "gitHubUrl": "https://github.com/example",
  "skillIds": [1, 3, 5]
}
